        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:504f0e09bd91bdd581b5a862",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好歌剧无论摆出什么姿势，\n在摩天轮里都不会晃动。\n……好强壮的深层肌肉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf8883cf7d99c0d2a276945d80ec4541d96178d8a5a6ebb8750c36b6ad1783e6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1015/storytimeline_501015511.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dc31994fcb7ce37c630f788",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可是坐摩天轮不就是要欣赏风景吗……\n我虽然这样想，但看到她朝气蓬勃的模样，\n竟然也被她感染了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47134500cd61b5783f6e9cd9aa9f69cabf447d4caec6523304aa32d037e3c6cc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
